h Enterprises & Quant Fintechs (VMO ID: ENT2026-GLOBAL-VMO026), effective July 2026. Recruitment partnership status means Arzon Global supports talent acquisition through candidate sourcing, screening, and presentation. All hiring decisions are at the sole discretion of partner employer teams. No placement guarantee is implied by recruitment partner status. Programme fees and refund policy are published in the public trust ledger. ASCI guidelines apply to all marketing communications. ISO 9001:2015 certified. MSME UDYAM registered. MCA incorporated."],["P",{"class":"font-mono text-[9px] text-slate-500","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/landing/Footer.tsx:195:11"},"© 2026 Arzon Global Labs. All rights reserved. Registered under Ministry of Corporate Affairs, Govt of India."]]]]]]],["DIV",{"aria-hidden":"true","role":"status","class":"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#070B16] transition-opacity duration-500 opacity-0","style":"visibility:hidden","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/transition/SpaceLoader.tsx:15:5"},["DIV",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"absolute inset-0","style":"background:radial-gradient(60% 50% at 50% 45%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--primary-glow, #60A5FA) 22%, transparent), transparent 70%)","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/transition/SpaceLoader.tsx:24:7"}],["DIV",{"class":"ce-stars ce-stars-1","aria-hidden":"true","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/transition/SpaceLoader.tsx:36:11"}],["DIV",{"class":"ce-stars ce-stars-2","aria-hidden":"true","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/transition/SpaceLoader.tsx:37:11"}],["DIV",{"class":"ce-stars ce-stars-3","aria-hidden":"true","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/transition/SpaceLoader.tsx:38:11"}],["DIV",{"class":"relative flex flex-col items-center gap-6","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/transition/SpaceLoader.tsx:43:7"},["DIV",{"class":"relative h-24 w-24","data-tsd-source":"/src/components/transition/SpaceLoader.tsx:44:9"},["DIV",{"aria-hid